{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>My wrong</b> — Twice in the Masorah: חמסי עליך · חמסי ושארי על כבל תאמר יושבת ציון. Juxtaposes Sarah to Zion; it is said of Sarah כי שרה עקרה and Zion עקרה. Just as Sarah brought in a rival wife, so Israel — the nations are their rivals."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:12.391360062Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}